The Qualcomm SMEM v12 wire layout and allocation protocol follow Linux v6.12,
drivers/soc/qcom/smem.c, at adc218676eef25575469234709c2d87185ca223a:
https://github.com/torvalds/linux/blob/adc218676eef25575469234709c2d87185ca223a/drivers/soc/qcom/smem.c

